   "sessionId": "6174a0c0-8bf7-4244-98ba-7c4b8591c2d2",
   "category": "operations",
   "questionText": "What are the top 3 KPIs you use to measure operational performance and what are their current values vs. targets?",
   "answerText": "Three, and only the first is measured the same way at all three sites. OEE on Line 3 runs at 62 percent against a target of 78. Unplanned downtime across the plant is 7.4 percent against a 5.1 percent reference median. Inventory turns are 5.2 against a median of 6.8. Changeover time is reported as a fourth measure but Rotherham, Leeds and Wakefield each start the clock at a different point, so the figures are not comparable and I would not put them in front of the board yet.",
   "isRequired": true,
   "answerType": "long_text",
