   "answerText": "There is a Lean programme on paper from 2023 with trained green belts, but it is not running as a system. Improvement work happens when a customer complaint forces it. The Operational Excellence steering group meets monthly and reviews numbers, which is closer to governance than to continuous improvement. Training hours per full-time employee are 11 against a reference median of 18, which is the leading indicator of why the programme stalled.",
