   "answerText": "Coverage is high and currency is mixed. The core production processes are documented \u2014 the Line 3 changeover instruction WI-OPS-118 is current and technically correct. The gap is not the document but the doing: the audit found the preparation checks in the fifteen minutes before a changeover are not consistently performed. Goods-in is the one clear documentation gap, because Wakefield still runs it on paper while Leeds and Rotherham run the tablet flow.",
