   "sessionId": "6174a0c0-8bf7-4244-98ba-7c4b8591c2d2",
   "category": "operations",
   "questionText": "What is the single biggest operational improvement opportunity you see today?",
   "answerText": "Protecting the planned maintenance window, and making the short stops visible. Neither needs capital. Both are decisions about who is allowed to change what, and both are measurable within a quarter. Everything else on the 2027 list \u2014 the MES rollout, the warehouse pilot, the upskilling programme \u2014 gets easier once the measurement chain is trustworthy, and stays arguable until it is.",
